{"4601370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yashi - Sand Driver", "steam_appid": 4601370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an endless desert, you are Yashi, a lone survivor... until this radio signal changes everything. Jump in your van with your faithful coyote, drive across the wastelands, survive the heat, scavenge resources, craft tools, fight the elements &amp; find your way to New Eden in this feel-good road trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/7c08d7f9fbe51f334efa0b8b9bb482d9.webp?t=1788207565\" width=401 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/8ab7bf8250c2d9d7780fd2855f4c2879.poster.avif?t=1788207565\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/8ab7bf8250c2d9d7780fd2855f4c2879.webm?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/8ab7bf8250c2d9d7780fd2855f4c2879.mp4?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the vast wilderness of the desert. Drive your van across treacherous terrain, overcome obstacles, and venture through winding canyons and towering peaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/6a28517a4763b25d7fe9ec86e802fb00.webp?t=1788207565\" width=415 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/2d65daab1e715855630b7e2965defc0a.poster.avif?t=1788207565\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/2d65daab1e715855630b7e2965defc0a.webm?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/2d65daab1e715855630b7e2965defc0a.mp4?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for food and water, and manage your resources carefully to withstand the relentless heat. Oases can offer relief along the way, but venturing into the unknown without preparation can be deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/bdb65d9651bde1eef732833d35ac4b22.webp?t=1788207565\" width=434 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/a9501b700a90f4802b085878e056efda.poster.avif?t=1788207565\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/a9501b700a90f4802b085878e056efda.webm?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/a9501b700a90f4802b085878e056efda.mp4?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage metal from abandoned vehicles, search ruined cities for valuable supplies, gather vegetation, and recover useful materials. Combine your finds to upgrade your van and unlock powerful abilities, from enhanced jump and mid-air control to turbo boost and harpoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/6671225dcfa5ea102324660525f37c4e.webp?t=1788207565\" width=394 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/74922686f211d05de6840cd0147de662.poster.avif?t=1788207565\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/74922686f211d05de6840cd0147de662.webm?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/74922686f211d05de6840cd0147de662.mp4?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face raging sandstorms, lightning strikes, hurricanes, and deadly chasms. Every obstacle can stop your journey—or push you to find a new path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/6ca08cebf2998ef1a02b2950d20c4e03.webp?t=1788207565\" width=597 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/0e85a14782c143cc1ff38539a480c5fc.poster.avif?t=1788207565\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/0e85a14782c143cc1ff38539a480c5fc.webm?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/0e85a14782c143cc1ff38539a480c5fc.mp4?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the mysterious radio signal from New Eden to chart its location. Navigate the desert, uncover its secrets, and reach the community that awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/0a4cb7489bb485d31a22c6947e7d785f.webp?t=1788207565\" width=461 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there! I'm Mathias and I've been creating video games since I was a child. I love coding, playing music and drawing. So what's better than creating a video game to do all of this at the same time? I do everything alone because I love every part of it and I'm a curious guy who likes to know how it works! I hope you'll like it :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't hesitate to <strong>follow my Steam developer page</strong> to be notified of all my new games. And if you like feel-good adventure games, you may want to try my last game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/6c606cf2558d6fca8ac5fba395f36700.avif?t=1788207565\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support me or learn more, don't hesitate to check out my website, where you can find all the links to social media, my dev blog and other stuff. Thank you so much!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an endless desert, you are Yashi, a lone survivor... until this radio signal changes everything. Jump in your van with your faithful coyote, drive across the wastelands, survive the heat, scavenge resources, craft tools, fight the elements &amp; find your way to New Eden in this feel-good road trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/7c08d7f9fbe51f334efa0b8b9bb482d9.webp?t=1788207565\" width=401 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/8ab7bf8250c2d9d7780fd2855f4c2879.poster.avif?t=1788207565\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/8ab7bf8250c2d9d7780fd2855f4c2879.webm?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/8ab7bf8250c2d9d7780fd2855f4c2879.mp4?t=1788207565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the vast wilderness of the desert. Drive your van across treacherous terrain, overcome obstacles, and venture through winding canyons and towering peaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/6a28517a4763b25d7fe9ec86e802fb00.webp?t=1788207565\" width=415 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/2d65daab1e715855630b7e2965defc0a.poster.avif?t=1788207565\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst