 location. Navigate the desert, uncover its secrets, and reach the community that awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/0a4cb7489bb485d31a22c6947e7d785f.webp?t=1788207565\" width=461 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there! I'm Mathias and I've been creating video games since I was a child. I love coding, playing music and drawing. So what's better than creating a video game to do all of this at the same time? I do everything alone because I love every part of it and I'm a curious guy who likes to know how it works! I hope you'll like it :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't hesitate to <strong>follow my Steam developer page</strong> to be notified of all my new games. And if you like feel-good adventure games, you may want to try my last game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601370/extras/6c606cf2558d6fca8ac5fba395f36700.avif?t=1788207565\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support me or learn more, don't hesitate to check out my website, where you can find all the links to social media, my dev blog and other stuff. Thank you so much!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In an endless desert, you are Yashi, a lone survivor... until this radio signal changes everything. Jump in your van with your faithful coyote, drive across the wastelands, survive the heat, scavenge resources, craft tools, fight the elements &amp; find your way to New Eden in this feel-good road trip.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "reviews": "“Being a coyote in a peaceful desert with *NO BIRD* to annoy you? Count me in.”<b